            <ArticleTitle>[Treatment and prophylaxis of fibula stump syndrome].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author presents in the article the results of treatment patients with fibula stump syndrome. Some aspects of pathogenesis of development of this form of amputation pain after amputation were clarified by the author in the article as well as clinical and morphological disease criteria. Differential assessment of efficiency of conservative treatment and surgery depending on the severity of pain syndrome has been carried out.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
